{"message":"I added 2 checked bags to reservation HXDUBJ at no additional cost.

I cannot upgrade only the outbound flight to business class. Policy requires the cabin class to remain the same across all flights in the same reservation, so changing cabin for just one flight segment is not possible.

The full business class upgrade for both flights would cost $408, which is above your $200 limit, so I did not make that cabin change."}

